# FizzBuzz 1..15
Text tau 1 "Fizz"
Text tau 2 "Buzz"
Set r0 1
loop:
Jgt r0 15 end
Set r1 r0
Mod r1 15
Jeq r1 0 both
Set r1 r0
Mod r1 3
Jeq r1 0 fizz
Set r1 r0
Mod r1 5
Jeq r1 0 buzz
PrintInt r0
Jump next
both:
Print 1
Print 2
Jump next
fizz:
Print 1
Jump next
buzz:
Print 2
next:
Newline
Add r0 1
Jump loop
end:
Halt
